    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528220/extras/665e6792e079605f2415118a927f1928.poster.avif?t=1745571982\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528220/extras/665e6792e079605f2415118a927f1928.webm?t=1745571982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>The Isle of Lye is a specially constructed testing ground for the Gordian Society, and as fate would have it, you have ended up here. <br><br>It is up to you to rise to the challenge and find a way out of this place, all the while competing to become a full fledged member of this enigmatic organisation.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528220/extras/1b74ab3f65d8c74416f0f9d22f025f33.poster.avif?t=1745571982\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528220/extras/1b74ab3f65d8c74416f0f9d22f025f33.webm?t=1745571982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>As you explore the island, you will get to know the quirky Lye family and their numerous associates. From servants to family members, everyone is more than they let on.<br><br>Can you find the black sheep of the family or the traitor in the mansion?<br>Or perhaps you'd prefer to search for someone else's carefully hidden treasures...<br>Will you get to the bottom of every mystery?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528220/extras/b43a424610d1a6d091be1fb32d06e56d.poster.avif?t=1745571982\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528220/extras/b43a424610d1a6d091be1fb32d06e56d.webp?t=1745571982\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528220/extras/665e6792e079605f2415118a927f1928.poster.avif?t=1745571982\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528220/extras/665e6792e079605f2415118a927f1928.webm?t=1745571982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>The Isle of Lye is a specially constructed testing ground for the Gordian Society, and as fate would have it, you have ended up here. <br><br>It is up to you to rise to the challenge and find a way out of this place, all the while competing to become a full fledged member of this enigmatic organisation.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528220/extras/1b74ab3f65d8c74416f0f9d22f025f33.poster.avif?t=1745571982\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528220/extras/1b74ab3f65d8c74416f0f9d22f025f33.webm?t=1745571982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>As you explore the island, you will get to know the quirky Lye family and their numerous associates. From servants to family members, everyone is more than they let on.<br><br>Can you find the black sheep of the family or the traitor in the mansion?<br>Or perhaps you'd prefer to search for someone else's carefully hidden treasures...<br>Will you get to the bottom of every mystery?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528220/extras/b43a424610d1a6d091be1fb32d06e56d.poster.avif?t=1745571982\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528220/extras/b43a424610d1a6d091be1fb32d06e56d.webp?t=1745571982\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
